# Read by `vite build`, which compiles VITE_* values into the bundle.
#
# Committed on purpose: anything prefixed VITE_ ends up in JavaScript the browser downloads,
# so it holds no secret. Keeping it here means a release built by anyone — or by Render —
# points at the same API instead of falling back to the localhost default and shipping an
# admin panel that cannot reach anything.
#
# Temporary host while the production domain is set up. The API must also list this site's
# origin under Aynera:Cors:Origins, or the browser will block every request.
VITE_AYNERA_API_BASE_URL=https://aynera-api.onrender.com
